WEBVTT

00:12:57.185 --> 00:13:00.386
oduzima život cijeloga čovječanstva.

00:13:00.386 --> 00:13:07.582
Bilo tko tko spašava život, 
spašava život cijeloga čovječanstva.

00:13:07.582 --> 00:13:10.652
I u potpunosti bi se predao

00:13:10.652 --> 00:13:17.672
teškom i trnovitom procesu stvaranja mira.

00:13:17.672 --> 00:13:19.107
Hvala.

00:13:19.107 --> 00:13:23.506
(Pljesak)

00:13:23.506 --> 00:13:27.506
Hvala. (Pljesak)